{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/38711-demon-form-covers-armour-clothing-and-equiptment","id":38711,"title":"Demon Form, Covers, Armour, Clothing and Equiptment","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-29T07:01:45-08:00","id":38711,"title":"Demon Form, Covers, Armour, Clothing and Equiptment","content":"So when a demon changes into demon form,<br /> the physical body of the cover is folded out of reality,<br /> and the demon shows his true form.<br /> Presumably the covers clothing goes with him,<br /> as we don't seem demons going all werewolf and having there cloths constantly shredded.<br /> <br /> So some questions: <ol class=\"decimal\"><li><i>What happens to equiptment that is part of the cover?</i> Eg the Big Spender's Bulging Wallet? it must vanish since it is part of the cover.</li> <li><i>What happens to stuff that is in the Cover's clothing's pockets?</i> It must be folded out too since we don't see demonds littering every time they change forms</li> <li><i>If we put somehting in the pockets of a cover and then burn the cover by going loud, what happen's to the items? </i>I guess they go to the same place items in a self-destructed bolt hole go.</li> <li><i>If we have 2 covers, can we put a TNT vest on one, change out to the other, walk through security, change back, and then blow up the building?</i></li> <li><i>Can a demon wear armour?</i> I'm going for No, expecially if it isn't custom made, because some demons are sqarms of metalic bees, and others are size 9.</li> <li>If a demon can wear armour , can he keep wearing the same armour he was wering in his cover?</li> </ol><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1699-oxinabox","name":"o